'''FK Staiceles Bebri''' is a [[Latvia]]n football club. They compete in the second-highest division of Latvian football ([[Latvian First League|1. līga]]). It is based in [[Staicele]]. In the 2014 season they finished 2nd in the Latvian [[2. līga]] and were promoted to [[Latvian First League|1. līga]] also receiving a license for participation at that level.<ref name="lff">{{cite web|url=http://www.lff.lv/lv/turniri/viriesu-turniri/pirma-liga/jaunumi/klubu-licencesanas-komisijas-27-februara-lemums|title=The Decision of LFF Licensing Committee|publisher=www.lff.lv}}</ref>

